Moekoma: Tsuki, the API of the Kotatsu parsers

The code in this folder comes from Tsuki (https://github.com/UsagiApp/Tsuki),
at the tag 1.0.5 (commit 6baf1c0 of 2026-07-28). Tsuki is under the GNU General
Public License, version 3, which is in LICENSE. Moekoma is under the same license.

Tsuki is the API of the parsers of Gekkoushi/plugin-source, a maintained fork
of the Kotatsu parsers. The parser plugin of Gekkoushi was built against this
version. Moekoma did not change the files.
